      <div class="fav"><div><div>Blumen Weide</div><div class="ui-small">Çiçekçi · 520 m</div></div><span class="ui-small">3 gün önce</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="sheet" data-sheet="2" hidden>
  <div class="sheet-ui" data-ui aria-label="CatchIt kategori seçimi">
    <div class="top"><strong>Neleri görmek istersin?</strong></div>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip on">Kahve</span><span class="chip on">Fırın</span><span class="chip">Pastane</span>
      <span class="chip on">Pazar</span><span class="chip">Çiçekçi</span><span class="chip">Kuaför</span>
      <span class="chip">Restoran</span><span class="chip">Manav</span>
